"Non é posible iniciar o editor %1 . Por favor, verifica a configuración do "
"teu editor no menú de Preferencias."

msgctxt "MainWindow|"
msgid ""
"Your analyses were created in an older version of JASP, to change the PPI of "
"the images they must be refreshed first.\n"
"\n"
"Refresh all analyses?"
msgstr ""
"A túas análises creáronse cunha versión máis antiga de JASP; para cambiar os "
"PPI das imaxes debes actualizalas primeiro.\n"
"\n"
"Actualizar tódalas análises?"

msgctxt "MainWindow|"
msgid ""
"This analysis was created in an older version of JASP, to resize the image "
"it must be refreshed first.\n"
"\n"
"Refresh the analysis?"
msgstr ""
"Esta análise creouse nunha versión máis antiga de JASP; para cambiar o "
"tamaño da imaxe debes actualizala primeiro.\n"
"\n"
"Actualizar a análise?"

msgctxt "MainWindow|"
msgid "Datafile changed"
msgstr "O ficheiro de datos cambiou"

msgctxt "MainWindow|"
msgid "Save JASP Image"
msgstr "Gardar imaxe de JASP"

msgctxt "MainWindow|"
msgid "Do you really want to remove all analyses?"
msgstr "Queres realmente eliminar todas as análises?"

msgctxt "MainWindow|"
msgid ""
"To be able to report the bug you need to have a GitHub account, do you have "
"such an account?"
msgstr ""
"Para poder informar do fallo, necesitas ter unha conta en GitHub. Tes ese "
"tipo de conta?"

msgctxt "MainWindow|"
msgid ""
"This analysis was created in an older version of JASP, to save the image it "
