msgctxt "PrefsUI|"
msgid "Daily automatic check for updates & known issues"
msgstr ""
"Comprobación automática diaria de actualizacións e incidencias coñecidas"

msgctxt "PrefsUI|"
msgid ""
"JASP doesn't share any of your data when it gets updates, not even which "
"version of JASP you are using.\n"
"It does share your IP-address with the server but that is required for "
"internet to function.\n"
"\n"
"The list of known issues it downloads is rarely used, mostly the issues are "
"at [jasp-issues](https://github.com/jasp-stats/jasp-issues/issues). However "
"if we realize a terrible error has slipped into an analysis this will show "
"you *in the analysis* that there is something you should take into account. "
"Luckily we almost never need to use it."
msgstr ""
"JASP non comparte ningún dos teus datos cando fai actualizacións, nin "
"sequera que versión de JASP estás utilizando.\n"
"Comparte a túa dirección IP co servidor, pero iso é necesario para que "
"funcione internet.\n"
"\n"
"A lista de incidencias coñecidas que descarga utilízase raramente; e a "
"maioría das incidencias están en [jasp-issues](https://github.com/jasp-stats/"
"jasp-issues/issues). Porén, se caemos na conta de que se deslizou un erro "
"grave nunha análise, váiseche indicar *na análise* que hai algo que deberías "
"ter en conta. Afortunadamente, case nunca necesitamos utilizar isto."

