msgctxt "MainWindow|"
msgid ""
"Should JASP check for updates at our server and let you know if there is a "
"new version?\n"
"\n"
"JASP doesn't share any of your data when it gets updates, not even which "
"version of JASP you are using.\n"
"It does share your IP-address with our server but that is required for "
"internet to function.\n"
"\n"
"This setting can always be changed in the Interface Preferences."
msgstr ""
"Debe procurar JASP as actualizacións no noso servidor e comunicarte se hai "
"unha versión nova?\n"
"\n"
"JASP non comparte ningún dos teus datos cando fai actualizacións, nin "
"sequera que versión de JASP estás utilizando.\n"
"Comparte a túa dirección IP co noso servidor, pero iso é necesario para que "
"funcione internet.\n"
"\n"
"Esta configuración pode sempre cambiarse nas Preferencias da Interface."

