msgctxt "PrefsAI|"
msgid ""
"When enabled, each tool in the API request includes its full parameter "
"schema (with JSON such as like integer/boolean). This helps models that "
"struggle with type-safety in tool calls (e.g., Qwen). Uses more tokens. "
"Leave unticked for DeepSeek."
msgstr ""
